### note: Operational readiness check for derived Domain Catalog RAG materialization. Requires a published config-starter build with ingested catalog releases and vector-store status support.

@baseUrl = https://praxis-api-quickstart.onrender.com
@tenantId = demo
@envId = local
@allowedOrigin = http://localhost:4301
@serviceKey = praxis-service
@resourceKey = human-resources.funcionarios

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/praxis/config/domain-catalog/rag/status?serviceKey={{serviceKey}}&resourceKey={{resourceKey}}
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{allowedOrigin}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Env: {{envId}}
